WEBVTT

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.300
Excuse me...

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.960
Yes?

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.150
When did my son come back?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:14.050
I'm not sure... wouldn't he be careful not to wake up his father?

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.660
I was awake since half past three, though.

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.110
President.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.300
I'm sorry.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.650
nemuri nasai ima wa tada

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:01.650
Sleep, for now

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:08.560
watashi no naka de doko ni mo ikanai de

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:08.560
Inside of me, and don't go anywhere

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:29.570
madoromi no fuchi de yureteru gunjou iro no yo

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:29.570
Through the slumbering ultramarine sky

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:35.090
majiwaru koto no nai hoshi wo sagashiteru

00:01:29.830 --> 00:01:35.090
I am searching for stars that will never cross

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:42.790
anata wo motomeru yubisaki yami ni samayotte

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:42.790
These fingertips search for you, but are lost in darkness

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:51.670
mogaite mo nukedesenai ai no umi ni oboreteku

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:51.670
I try but I can't escape, and I drown in the sea of love

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:59.560
yawaranai toiki ni kokoro sae mo furueru

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:59.560
Your tender sigh makes my heart tremble

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:05.180
karamaru utsukushi kumo no ito no you

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:05.180
Seemingly entangled in the beautiful strands of a spider web

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:09.670
ugokenai no watashi wo yurushite

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:09.670
I cannot move, please forgive me

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:13.000
anata no ude ni dakarete nemuru

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:13.000
I am sleeping with your arms around me

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.220
nani mo kamo sutetatte ii

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.220
I don't mind losing anything else

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:23.750
ii kono mama no maboroshi nante zukuru no wa yamete

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:23.750
Stop pretending that you are a good girl

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.210
hontou no watashi wo mitsukete

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:27.210
Find the real me

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:33.290
zutto matteru

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:33.290
I'll be waiting forever

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.930
He told me not to come?

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:46.320
I'm in the hospital already though. I'll leave soon...

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:48.120
So... yeah,

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:50.760
Give me another hour.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.790
Don't force yourself. Go take care of your father.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.460
I'm not forcing myself.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.880
There's no need to stay beside him the whole day.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.780
It's nothing serious. He's so healthy he's kind of annoying.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:05.600
So I'll come.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.210
You don't have to.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:10.060
I have to, it's the last lesson of the year-

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.060
Ah, bye!

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:14.430
Go-yah, come-yah, I don't want you to come! Just kidding.

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.000
Huh, Maya, hello?

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:30.580
Page 15
What isn't found, will destroy all around it.
Because it's not there, 
there's nothing that can be done about it.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.780
So your teacher's skipping class?

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.290
It can't really be called skipping...

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.420
How about you?

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.770
Touya-kun, you said Friday...

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:43.000
I was defeated.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.920
By my own student too.

00:03:45.950 --> 00:03:47.790
Thanks to Haruka.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.520
Jeez, she's totally interfering with my business.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.930
Haruka?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:54.100
Haruka's also tutoring?

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.120
Yeah.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:58.860
It also seems like Haruka-sensei's more popular than I am.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:02.840
Then... will you lose out on your paycheck?

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:07.790
Well... now that you mention it, I've never met her parents.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:10.040
I guess.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.580
So it's not about money.

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.210
It is about

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.210
It is about

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.210
money

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:17.210
money

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:21.380
Yuki, you don't have lessons today?

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:23.320
Not just today.

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.240
I was told to take a break until next year.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:31.830
What should I do? If I forget everything that I was taught, then...

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.430
Isn't that a good thing?

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:37.090
You can focus on your job.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:42.370
Today was meant to be just the lesson, so...

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:45.010
So it's...

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:46.610
a break?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.660
What a shame!

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:54.360
Damn it, my father's a bastard.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:56.450
You can't say that!

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:58.870
It's thanks to your father that we're-

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.670
I'm such an idiot!

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:06.470
Why... why am I always like that...

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:10.870
Didn't I tell you not to worry? You've always been this way-

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.290
What's wrong, Yuki?

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:17.380
I'm sorry, Touya-kun.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:20.250
But it's true.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.400
I've always been very...

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:26.270
Yuki...

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:31.600
So many people came to my first concert...

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.060
You came too, Touya-kun...

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:39.750
People clapped and cheered for me, I was so happy I was over the moon...

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:45.080
But, I was the only one who was happy...

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:45.970
That's not it-

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.750
Everyone else was not!

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.700
Ogata-san, Rina-chan, Yayoi-san,

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.490
Misaki-san, Akira-kun, Haruka, they all...

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:56.470
You too, Touya-kun!

00:05:57.060 --> 00:06:01.310
There's so much to think about now that I'm older...

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.130
The people who came to see me, I'm sure that's the case too!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.720
I... Yuki can't do anything.

00:06:12.380 --> 00:06:16.590
I knew it, but I didn't notice it...

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:20.770
actually, more like I pretended not to notice it...

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:25.860
The me who looks up to myself is an idiot, such an idiot, it's pathetic...

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:29.560
Ogata-san...

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.360
does not like what I have become.

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:35.090
That's why we're taking a break from the lessons...

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.220
The Fujii Touya line, the Fujii Touya line.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.130
Please board quickly.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:48.020
This place has been pretty empty recently, dear customer.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.610
The seat on my back.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:06:57.020
Yes...

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.320
But, I cannot sit now...

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.440
I'm sorry, Mr. Driver.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:26.300
You tired?

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.780
Not at all!

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:28.940
How's your 'flu?

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.370
My 'flu? Eh, where, where did it go?

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.760
So it's gone.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.910
We'll do some uphill training tomorrow.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.080
Understood, coach!

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:02.040
Store temporarily closed

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:32.010
Due to the pro baseball player's change of contract, the first player worth a hundred million yen has-

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.230
So you were with Morikawa-san the whole of last night too?

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:37.910
Ouch-

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.140
Yeah.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:45.270
No matter how many times you meet...

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:47.290
it's still not enough?

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.150
Yeah. I wonder who's to blame.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:54.750
Does an idol really get that much free time?

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.090
How does it feel...

00:08:57.090 --> 00:09:01.540
to see an idol... in real life for the first time?

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.070
It's not the first time.

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:06.820
You've met before?

00:09:06.820 --> 00:09:11.950
During her third year of high school, I don't know how many times we've talked over the phone.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.190
Heh, so it's only over the phone huh.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:17.030
She was a princess, just like her voice.

00:09:17.030 --> 00:09:19.740
Despite my efforts to keep you from meeting her.

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.630
During the funeral of your mother...

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:24.870
I didn't let her come. I didn't want to let her see.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:26.580
To see your mother?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.780
Or to see me?

00:09:27.780 --> 00:09:29.780
Anything to do with that period of time.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:35.020
I wonder... if she will come to my funeral.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.070
What on earth are you saying?

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:38.730
What happened to your usual attitude-

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:47.910
What the hell, making yourself cry...

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.290
You've become soft or something?

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.810
Don't be stupid.

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:58.760
This is what you end up seeing inside your head, after having lived this long.

00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:02.030
Ah, but a little kid like you wouldn't know.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:06.080
All these memories, experiences, and recollections...

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:10.300
An endless number of fragments, all of which have nothing to do with each other...

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:15.550
Due to some event, assemble together magically all of a sudden.

00:10:16.340 --> 00:10:19.640
Not just sad or painful things,

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:25.590
But also fun things, happy things, time and place all line up together.

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:31.430
It's just like skimming through a magazine.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:35.210
And the endpoint of it all, for some reason,

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.380
is always connected to your tear glands.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:41.300
You shouldn't be talking too much.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:44.200
So this is it, huh.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:45.850
You don't understand, do you?

00:10:46.030 --> 00:10:46.810
Ah.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:51.210
You've never experienced something that made you cry.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:52.680
I understand!

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:56.940
I don't have any memories or experiences, but I still cry!

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:00.340
I cry for my companions.

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:05.300
It was the same for you wasn't it, when you were young?

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:09.220
Your friends, or your lover, all of your companions,

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:10.630
Have you forgotten about them?

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:15.330
Companions? They're worth nothing.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:16.440
Didn't I already say this?

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:18.570
It's best to be alone.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.360
You will be alone, until the end.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:29.310
I don't

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:29.310
I don't

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.940
want to become

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.940
want to become

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:30.110
alone

00:11:26.480 --> 00:11:30.110
alone

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:30.110
want to become

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:30.110
want to become

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:35.540
And so Frankie, I...

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:40.150
I know you've heard it a million times, but please listen.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:45.330
When I look at this oil painting that I don't even know the name of, I can't help but cry.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.540
I was just... very sad.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.780
I know the reason, now.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.850
There's three sadnesses of mine within it.

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.540
The sadness of losing something, the sadness of realizing I lost something,

00:12:10.060 --> 00:12:11.050
And...

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.870
The sadness of not being able to obtain it...

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:18.090
even though it was right there in front of my eyes.

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:23.410
This painting is my mother. We've never met,

00:12:23.410 --> 00:12:27.040
but she's definitely my mother.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:28.110
Nope!

00:12:30.110 --> 00:12:31.820
It's not the girl I'm talking about.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:33.960
Mother...

00:12:47.040 --> 00:12:51.340
And the next song, of course it's a hit, Ogata Rina-

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:12.950
I'm sorry.

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:18.220
Canceling the lessons was all for my convenience.

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.650
You did nothing wrong.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.670
Yes.

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:26.670
After a concert like that, for you to be all worried like that is just...

00:13:26.670 --> 00:13:29.780
You don't have enough of it yet, don't you? Happiness, that is.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.410
It's decided! Let's multiply Yuki's happiness.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:41.120
We'll fill your heart with happiness, bit by bit, and let it swell...

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.820
Until it bursts, and the blast envelops your fans...

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:50.910
Me too, Yuki.

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.940
Scatter some of that powder of happiness on me too...

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:59.020
I, who have been hit with sorrow... restore happiness in me!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:34.570
Die...

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:36.790
I'm gonna die!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:40.180
You don't have to force yourself if it's that tough for you.

00:14:40.180 --> 00:14:41.780
I'll die!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:44.330
I was planning to come by myself anyway-

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.490
Why are you saying something like that?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.510
But...

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.390
No, take me with you.

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:58.840
Mana-chan...

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:03.300
Haruka-chi, don't leave me alone like the others have...

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:12.020
Yes, I understand.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:25.160
New Year's Eve... why?

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.700
Because it's New Year's Eve.

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.960
Then why?

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:31.530
The President said so.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.270
"Make Yuki happy", he said.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:38.040
As I thought.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.290
Ah, I came to visit today.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:00.900
Yo.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.160
Perfect.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.620
Are you guys doing anything over New Year's?

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.710
As I thought, home is best.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:29.270
But when I remember that I have to go back to that prison after the 3rd...

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:33.610
It would be great if Fujii-kun could also return home though...

00:16:33.900 --> 00:16:37.030
He's just looking out for me by not doing that.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:37.530
Eh?

00:16:38.160 --> 00:16:42.440
Misaki-san! Could you come and taste some of this soba sauce?

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:43.140
Ah, I'll go now.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:49.480
I've gone camping with Haruka. Mana

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.280
God damn it, she too, them too...

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.000
Because she's my daughter?

00:16:57.110 --> 00:16:58.850
Heh, as if.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.700
How much further?

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:12.110
We're here.

00:17:12.110 --> 00:17:12.800
Eh?

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:15.180
Where are we?

00:17:15.180 --> 00:17:16.640
We're still in Yuunagi city.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.450
I don't believe you!

00:17:19.450 --> 00:17:21.730
Since it's something Haruka the bad person said.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.730
Ah, wait up!

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:31.660
The lights?

00:17:31.660 --> 00:17:32.650
They don't work.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:37.550
Woah, a fireplace!

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:40.240
After dinner, let's sleep until the sun rises.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:42.220
Here?

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:44.700
You brought your sleeping bag with you, right?

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:47.860
I'm changing "Haruka the bad person" to "Haruka the monster"!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:00.880
Let's go on a date.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:03.170
Why is Mana-chan in Touya's room?!

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.150
I don't like it!

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.690
Well then, the stage is yours!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:09.570
The song, naturally, is-

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.000
Yuki...

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:14.690
Touya-kun, let's go for a walk!

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:16.070
Not going.

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.300
I'm so glad the weather's good.

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.410
Yep.

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:38.410
Ogata-san forgave me.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:38.930
Really.

00:18:40.530 --> 00:18:41.890
If it's okay this year-

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:45.400
What?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.360
Eh, um...

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.000
What is it?

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:50.000
Say it

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:55.710
I'm sorry.

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.540
But, anyway...

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:00.560
Happy New Year, Touya-kun-

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:25.980
Well then, I'm taking the picture.

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:31.250
All right, say "cheese"!

00:19:32.290 --> 00:19:34.510
Come on, smile, smile!

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:43.830
Rina-san, thanks for your hard work!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.080
Thanks for your hard work.

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.950
Well, it's almost time...

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:00.950
Where are you going?

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:04.710
We're visiting the shrine for New Year's... right?

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:04.610
We can't...

00:21:05.470 --> 00:21:08.190
We can't do it here...

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.980
Not here?

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:12.350
Then where?

00:21:13.400 --> 00:21:15.380
It's already been a month...

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:20.110
Nanase-kun! We're gonna wake Touya's dad up...

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.660
Come to Echoes tomorrow morning.

00:21:34.820 --> 00:21:37.750
The shop will reopen on the 5th - Happy New Year!

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:55.770
Happy New Year, youngster.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:00.500
Oh, hmm?

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:09.410
I found them out.

00:22:14.380 --> 00:22:16.790
I went in the end.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.310
Where?

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.200
The New Year's shrine visit.

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:23.030
Very good. Things will now be easier.

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:56.090
watashi ni itsumo anata wa yasashii

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:56.090
You have always been kind to me

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:02.680
sono yasashisa ga fuan ni suru

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:02.680
But this kindness makes me insecure

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:11.500
unmei no ito hodokenai you ni

00:23:04.850 --> 00:23:11.500
This string of fate, I'll retie it over and over

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.120
nando mo musubi naoshite

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:18.120
So that it will never come loose

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:26.500
tsugi ni au yakusoku dekinai mama

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:26.500
I don't want to hear you say goodbye

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:36.440
wakare no kotoba mada kikitaku wa nai yo

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:36.440
Until we make promises to meet again

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.180
aenai yoru ni yume de aetara

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:44.180
Even if we can't meet tonight, 
if I can see you in my dreams

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:52.090
ashita ga tsurakute mo waratte irareru

00:23:44.580 --> 00:23:52.090
Even if tomorrow is difficult I'll be able to smile

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:59.550
donna ni tooku hanarete ite mo

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:59.550
No matter how far apart we may become

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:09.520
tsunagatte ireru to shinjite iru

00:23:59.830 --> 00:24:09.520
I believe that we will still be connected together

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:23.090
Page 16

00:24:24.290 --> 00:24:26.400
Thinking back to when one was young,

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:28.510
There are things so embarrassing it makes one writhe in agony.

00:24:29.490 --> 00:24:30.890
Compared to that...

00:24:31.800 --> 00:24:33.020
White Album.
